## Release Decision

The current ControlRig/AnimBP MCP source surface is coherent enough for the
next sample/temp-only workstream. Phase 1 read-only skeleton profile and
recipe-planning evidence are ready for use. Do not add new C++ for arbitrary
RigVM units, ControlRig variables/functions/exposed pins, broad AnimGraph
rewrites, linked Anim Graph/Layer authoring, stable binding-contract input
defaults beyond `PiperStable_GlobalStableGate_CTRL=1.0`, or original asset
mutation without a fresh Ieta review tied to a concrete passing proof and
failing request.

See also
`Docs/Analysis/controlrig_stable_authoring_phase1_handoff.md`,
`Docs/Analysis/controlrig_stable_authoring_phase2_handoff.md`, and
`Docs/Analysis/controlrig_stable_authoring_phase6_handoff.md` for the current
Ieta/Tivret handoff boundaries.

## Residual Notes

- Historical CubelessStylized, StackOBot, and old script records may still
  mention bridge port `55557`. Those records should not be bulk rewritten.
- Some older standalone smoke scripts under `Python/scripts/` still hardcode
  `55557`; update only when those scripts become active release gates for this
  UE 5.6.1 fork.
